                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">This course is the first step for dental students to learn about stomatology. It mainly includes the overview of stomatology, and the knowledge of oral structures, endodontics, periodontology, pediatric dentistry, oral mucosal diseases, oral and maxillofacial surgery, prosthodontics, orthodontics, and preventive dentistry. it will help the students understand the major of the stomatology, enhance their recognition of stomatology, and stimulating their professional enthusiasm.</span></p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
